WEBVTT

00:05.830 --> 00:09.160
Woah! Otakus!
Otakus everywhere!

00:09.160 --> 00:09.860
EAST HALL - E QUOTA
Are all these people otakus?!

00:09.860 --> 00:10.240
CIRCLE PARTICIPANTS AND CORPORATE EXHIBITORS
Are all these people otakus?!

00:10.240 --> 00:10.570
PROCEED UNDER THE ROOF
Are all these people otakus?!

00:10.570 --> 00:11.280
PORTABLE TOILET
Are all these people otakus?!

00:11.700 --> 00:15.970
It feels relief to know that all
these people here are all friends.

00:15.970 --> 00:18.790
I feel like I've unexpectedly
found my home planet.

00:18.790 --> 00:19.500
Eh?

00:20.070 --> 00:23.000
You guys are calm with this?

00:26.090 --> 00:30.680
2.5 DIMENSIONAL SEDUCTION

01:53.010 --> 01:58.010
#19 LET'S GO, SUMMER COMIKET!

01:58.010 --> 01:59.970
HANDLE THE CARRY-ON BAG WITH CARE

02:00.370 --> 02:02.340
They're all lined up so nicely.

02:02.340 --> 02:05.840
Both the staff managing the lines
and the guests are well trained.

02:05.840 --> 02:07.410
- Please proceed slowly,
- There may be a lot of people,

02:07.410 --> 02:09.320
- following the people in front.
- but they can enter the venue smoothly.

02:09.320 --> 02:12.820
But won't we die if we wait in this heat?

02:12.820 --> 02:14.990
Just be careful of heat stroke.

02:14.990 --> 02:17.010
SALT CANDY
Room temperature water! Frozen water!

02:17.010 --> 02:19.150
SALT CANDY
Salt candy! Ice packs! Electric fans!

02:19.150 --> 02:19.700
SALT CANDY
Enough for everyone!

02:19.700 --> 02:20.450
SALT CANDY
Oh!

02:21.110 --> 02:23.160
And hats for those
who forgot to bring theirs.

02:24.160 --> 02:26.620
You've thought of everything. Thanks.

02:26.620 --> 02:28.460
Senior, I want one too!

02:28.460 --> 02:29.600
Don't you already have one?

02:31.300 --> 02:35.180
Unlike those self-proclaimed boasters who go
to Mt. Fuji with light clothing and get lost,

02:35.180 --> 02:38.260
we otakus know exactly our limits.

02:38.260 --> 02:40.350
And I'm just the start. Look.

02:40.600 --> 02:41.270
CONNECT WITH A FAN

02:41.270 --> 02:41.850
A GAP BETWEEN THE BACKPACK AND THE BACK

02:41.850 --> 02:42.650
SPORTS DRINK TUBE

02:42.650 --> 02:43.350
SPORTS DRINK TUBE
Did they really come here just to buy manga?

02:43.350 --> 02:45.310
FULL ARMOR FOR COMIKET WARZONE
Did they really come here just to buy manga?

02:46.410 --> 02:47.910
Wait, that person...

02:47.910 --> 02:48.650
Hmm?

02:48.650 --> 02:51.260
Oh! If it isn't Okumura!

02:51.260 --> 02:52.890
So you guys really come here.

02:52.890 --> 02:54.980
Mr. Ogino and Miss Magino!

02:54.980 --> 02:56.770
You came for day one, too!

02:56.770 --> 02:59.030
Even though the cosrom
starts to sell on the 3rd day,

02:59.030 --> 03:02.320
I don't want to miss it
since Comiket is like a festival!

03:02.320 --> 03:04.970
Did you forget anything today?
Don't lose your costume, okay!

03:04.970 --> 03:06.000
I-It's okay.

03:06.000 --> 03:07.960
So something did happen last time.

03:08.490 --> 03:11.870
I've only heard rumors that you got
four people to do the full squad.

03:11.870 --> 03:12.340
What?

03:12.340 --> 03:13.990
It's been quite the buzz lately.

03:13.990 --> 03:15.170
Really?

03:15.710 --> 03:18.870
May I ask for Mikarin's autograph next time?

03:18.870 --> 03:21.680
I see you're following the popular celebrities.

03:21.760 --> 03:25.360
By the way, Comiket announced

03:25.360 --> 03:26.750
MR. CAMERA'S COSPLAY BLOG
the "Next Rising Stars Cosplayers"

03:26.750 --> 03:28.150
MR. CAMERA'S COSPLAY BLOG
ranking last night.

03:28.150 --> 03:29.940
MR. CAMERA'S COSPLAY BLOG
Oh, I didn't check it!

03:29.940 --> 03:32.150
MR. CAMERA'S COSPLAY BLOG
That's not good, Okumura.

03:32.700 --> 03:35.730
There are many rivals among the cosplayers.

03:35.730 --> 03:39.260
For example, you have to wait in line
to photograph the Four Heavenly Queens.

03:39.260 --> 03:41.610
And they have enthusiastic, diehard fans.

03:41.610 --> 03:44.950
In a sense, there are guests that
we can't steal no matter how hard we try.

03:45.520 --> 03:49.420
Other than that, our target audience
is people who just want

03:49.420 --> 03:51.030
to take pictures of cute girls!

03:51.030 --> 03:54.770
When we look at it that way,
it makes newcomers our biggest rivals.

03:54.770 --> 03:57.710
I-I see. So what about the rankings?

03:57.710 --> 03:59.910
Oh, right. About that...

03:59.910 --> 04:01.760
Coming in the 1st day...

04:01.760 --> 04:03.260
The 3rd and 2nd place!

04:03.730 --> 04:07.360
The twin cosplayers, Lemon & Lime!

04:07.360 --> 04:09.940
They are unique, rare, and extremely popular.

04:09.940 --> 04:13.730
And of course there is no one better than them
when cosplaying twin characters.

04:13.730 --> 04:17.300
Twin... The 2nd and 3rd places
were taken by a twin combo?!

04:17.300 --> 04:20.950
Since we've been blessed with
many amazing works this season,

04:20.950 --> 04:22.070
HELL MAIDS ANIME 2ND SEASON IS CONFIRMED
they're going to cosplay

04:22.070 --> 04:23.440
HELL MAIDS ANIME 2ND SEASON IS CONFIRMED
the most popular twin maids

04:23.440 --> 04:26.770
HELL MAIDS ANIME 2ND SEASON IS CONFIRMED
in the cosplay world, Shiro and Kuro!

04:26.770 --> 04:27.410
HELL MAIDS ANIME 2ND SEASON IS CONFIRMED
What?!

04:27.760 --> 04:29.580
They really announced the 2nd season now?!

04:29.580 --> 04:30.430
I want to see them!

04:30.430 --> 04:33.250
Get a grip, you otakus!
They're our rivals, remember?!

04:33.740 --> 04:36.880
- General line to West Hall, please move!
- Oh, the line is moving.

04:36.880 --> 04:39.220
B-But are we going to be okay?

04:39.710 --> 04:43.220
The Shiro Kuro twin cosplay
will definitely dominate...

04:43.220 --> 04:46.780
I can easily imagine they’ll create a buzz.

04:46.780 --> 04:51.170
A-Anyway, we just need our pictures
to reach Aria's dad, right?

04:51.590 --> 04:52.570
Yeah.

04:52.570 --> 04:56.300
But if he's the one who doesn't
check about cosplay news,

04:56.300 --> 04:59.950
it's hard to do that unless you're
the most talked-about cosplayer at Comiket.

05:00.430 --> 05:03.830
Anyway, Aria can participate
only today and tomorrow.

05:03.830 --> 05:06.540
All we can do now is attract
as big a crowd as we can,

05:06.540 --> 05:08.960
take plenty of pictures,
and upload them later!

05:10.940 --> 05:14.810
It seems you didn’t make the deadline
in time for the Obon festival.

05:14.810 --> 05:16.070
I'm sorry, everyone.

05:16.070 --> 05:19.760
No problem.
It's practically our Obon tradition.

05:19.760 --> 05:23.390
You were planning to go to Comiket to see
the Angel Airborne Squad cosplay, right?

05:23.390 --> 05:25.500
Wow, that’s rare of you, Sensei.

05:25.500 --> 05:27.370
No, it’s not like I want to go, though...

05:27.370 --> 05:31.440
Well, they always upload
the cute girls in real time every year.

05:31.440 --> 05:31.940
RECEPTION HOURS

05:31.940 --> 05:34.330
2 QUOTA
If any cuties come up, I'll show them to you.

05:34.330 --> 05:34.900
2 QUOTA

05:34.900 --> 05:38.360
Woah... Are these all cosplayers?!

05:38.360 --> 05:39.310
There's so many of them...

05:39.310 --> 05:40.930
- Be careful not to forget anything,
- This is our first time cosplaying at Comiket...

05:40.930 --> 05:42.540
- and make sure you have
- This is our first time cosplaying at Comiket...

05:42.540 --> 05:43.060
- a perfect makeover before you go out!
- This is our first time cosplaying at Comiket...

05:43.060 --> 05:44.890
- a perfect makeover before you go out!
- I'm really surprised.

05:44.890 --> 05:48.850
It's not gonna be easy
to stand out in this crowd.

05:48.850 --> 05:51.040
So these are our enemies, right?

05:51.040 --> 05:52.580
W-We are all friends here!

05:53.110 --> 05:55.230
But isn't our goal to be the best?

05:55.230 --> 05:56.880
Yeah, but...

05:56.880 --> 05:58.850
That's fine.

05:59.460 --> 06:02.820
Even in sports, we all have the same goal,

06:02.820 --> 06:05.210
but we compete with each other
for first place, right?

06:05.210 --> 06:06.600
Let's do it the same way!

06:07.690 --> 06:09.180
Sports?

06:09.620 --> 06:12.810
Don't tell me otakus never heard of sports?

06:12.810 --> 06:14.520
Huh? Wait...

06:14.940 --> 06:17.030
It's not here...
What should I do?

06:17.030 --> 06:18.050
Excuse me.

06:18.890 --> 06:22.610
Are you missing your wig net?
Here, I brought tons of spares.

06:22.610 --> 06:24.790
T-Thank you very much!

06:25.410 --> 06:27.360
It's exactly like what Aria said.

06:27.360 --> 06:28.850
We're all friends here.

06:30.930 --> 06:32.910
But today, we'll take first place!

06:39.900 --> 06:42.000
Senior, sorry for the wait.

06:42.000 --> 06:42.840
Oh?

07:03.150 --> 07:07.280
UWOOGGHH!

07:07.660 --> 07:10.810
We did it! We've made him have
the worst nosebleed he'll ever have!

07:10.810 --> 07:12.830
Ah, so that's normal, huh?

07:12.830 --> 07:14.580
His face is super red!

07:14.580 --> 07:17.120
He's getting flustered! We did it!

07:17.510 --> 07:20.450
So this time they each have
their own weapons...

07:20.450 --> 07:21.090
Yes!

07:21.830 --> 07:25.230
Comiket allows long props,
so I did my best to make them.

07:25.630 --> 07:27.090
Amazing.

07:27.470 --> 07:30.100
The 4 Airborne Squad Angels
are really here...

07:30.960 --> 07:33.580
This is the best Liliel I've ever seen.

07:33.580 --> 07:35.460
The best cosplay of all!

07:37.350 --> 07:39.940
What about me, Senior?!

07:39.940 --> 07:41.860
Of course you're the best Miriella!

07:41.860 --> 07:43.940
Nokiel and Ariel, too!

07:44.330 --> 07:46.710
I can already feel a lot of eyes on us...

07:46.710 --> 07:49.100
That's because your cosplays
are all of high quality.

07:49.100 --> 07:51.410
I-I'm kinda nervous now...

07:58.160 --> 07:59.920
Hey, Lilysa...

08:01.090 --> 08:04.470
This may be the first time
I'm saying this to you...

08:06.250 --> 08:07.970
I'm counting on you.

08:08.870 --> 08:10.180
What?

08:10.180 --> 08:11.060
RECOMMENDED COLD NOODLES

08:11.060 --> 08:13.510
RECOMMENDED COLD NOODLES
It was in the middle of summer

08:13.510 --> 08:15.430
RECOMMENDED COLD NOODLES
when Ash's War Chronicle ended.

08:16.180 --> 08:16.830
THANK YOU FOR READING!!
PLEASE LOOK FORWARD

08:16.830 --> 08:17.440
TO TAKAMATSU-SENSEI'S NEXT WORK!!
ASHFORD'S WAR CHRONICLE - END

08:18.580 --> 08:20.330
The last chapter...

08:20.330 --> 08:22.400
I won't be able to see Liliel anymore...

08:23.370 --> 08:25.770
How am I supposed to go on without her?

08:26.630 --> 08:29.410
Liliel saved me, and now she's gone.

08:29.870 --> 08:34.700
What can I look forward to
on that dreadful Monday?

08:35.260 --> 08:38.640
Maybe only otakus can
understand my feeling.

08:38.640 --> 08:39.460
But...

08:43.130 --> 08:45.260
That's how I truly felt.

08:45.630 --> 08:46.470
LILIEL'S SIDE STORY STARTS NEXT WEEK!

08:46.470 --> 08:47.950
LILIEL'S SIDE STORY STARTS NEXT WEEK!
Liliel's side story...

08:47.950 --> 08:48.610
WE'LL MEET AGAIN!

08:48.610 --> 08:51.610
WE'LL MEET AGAIN!
Saved me from being abandoned by this world.

08:52.550 --> 08:56.350
She gave me life up until today.

08:56.910 --> 08:58.810
My dad's manga...

08:58.810 --> 09:00.270
That's why...

09:00.730 --> 09:02.770
I'll be entrusting my part to you all.

09:03.150 --> 09:06.660
Put on your best cosplays
until it reaches Kisaki-sensei!

09:06.660 --> 09:08.740
Overwhelming gratitude from an otaku!

09:09.980 --> 09:10.890
Yes!

09:11.590 --> 09:13.270
All right! Gather round!

09:13.270 --> 09:13.930
Yes!

09:13.930 --> 09:14.580
Eh?

09:14.580 --> 09:15.440
What is this?!

09:15.440 --> 09:17.370
Liliel...

09:17.370 --> 09:20.080
L-Liliel...

09:20.080 --> 09:21.500
Explosion!

09:21.500 --> 09:22.820
Explosion?!

09:24.080 --> 09:26.420
FROM HERE
EAST, WEST, SOUTH HALLS

09:28.270 --> 09:30.790
Come on, Ms. Mayuri, we must go.

09:30.790 --> 09:35.310
Wait! Let me enjoy this moment before
they're swallowed up by the crowd!

09:35.310 --> 09:37.010
So you came, Liliel.

09:38.130 --> 09:39.780
M-Master Kai!

09:39.780 --> 09:41.530
That voice...

09:42.420 --> 09:43.270
Who are you?

09:43.270 --> 09:44.300
It's me! Nagomi!

09:44.300 --> 09:46.480
Ah, so you're cosplaying Racing Mika!

09:46.480 --> 09:47.120
EAST, WEST, SOUTH HALLS

09:47.120 --> 09:49.380
CLOAKROOM
Of course, I'm their official ambassador.

09:49.380 --> 09:53.950
Well, I suppose "I don't know you"
is the best compliment a cosplayer can receive.

09:54.790 --> 09:57.010
So you really aren't doing cosplay, Mayura.

09:57.010 --> 09:59.600
I mean, why are you dressed up like that?

09:59.600 --> 10:00.980
It's a festival.

10:00.980 --> 10:03.470
I was looking forward to
crushing you this year!

10:04.480 --> 10:07.550
If you're looking for a rival,
then you won't need me anymore.

10:08.220 --> 10:09.900
I've got my own disciple now.

10:11.070 --> 10:12.490
We'll see about that.

10:12.940 --> 10:16.630
There's a lot of Liliel
class cosplayers today.

10:17.460 --> 10:18.240
Look.

10:23.640 --> 10:26.400
That's Kuro from Hell Maids!

10:27.190 --> 10:29.590
It's a twintail festival!

10:29.590 --> 10:32.110
I can tell the costume
is high quality from here.

10:32.110 --> 10:35.460
Wait... Is she one of the twins
who took 2nd and 3rd place?

10:35.460 --> 10:39.700
You mean Lemon and Lime?
To be honest, they're hard to tell apart.

10:42.580 --> 10:44.920
You're so late, Lime!
What are you doing?

10:44.920 --> 10:47.040
MEN'S CHANGING ROOM
Sorry, it's surprisingly hard

10:47.040 --> 10:48.630
MEN'S CHANGING ROOM
for me to put it on by myself.

10:48.630 --> 10:51.220
MEN'S CHANGING ROOM
And I'm missing some parts for the costume.

10:51.220 --> 10:54.260
MEN'S CHANGING ROOM
What? Really? You forgot something?

10:54.260 --> 10:56.540
WOMEN'S CHANGING ROOM
I think it's in your bag, Lemon.

10:56.540 --> 10:57.520
WOMEN'S CHANGING ROOM
Huh?

10:57.520 --> 10:58.260
WOMEN'S CHANGING ROOM

11:05.830 --> 11:08.260
Excuse me, can I have a moment?

11:08.260 --> 11:09.370
Eh? Y-Yes!

11:09.370 --> 11:11.530
My partner is having trouble
in the changing room.

11:12.150 --> 11:15.010
Could you help me? I want you
to take this to the changing room!

11:15.010 --> 11:18.300
We have the same faces and costumes,
so you'll recognize my partner soon!

11:18.300 --> 11:21.330
- Huh? Why can't she do it herself?
- Sure, no problem.

11:21.810 --> 11:25.290
Ah, not you.
I meant the person behind you.

11:25.820 --> 11:26.600
What?

11:28.000 --> 11:29.960
MEN'S ONLY

11:30.910 --> 11:33.920
Did Lemon send you to help me?

11:34.580 --> 11:36.550
Thank you very much.

11:38.300 --> 11:40.850
Eh... Eh???

11:40.850 --> 11:41.640
Umm...

11:41.940 --> 11:43.900
Huh? Ah, yes?

11:43.900 --> 11:48.170
I'm sorry, but would you mind giving me
a hand to lift up the zipper on the back?

11:48.170 --> 11:49.710
Oh, sure.

11:49.710 --> 11:51.110
Thank you very much.

11:52.710 --> 11:53.580
Then...

11:54.010 --> 11:55.350
Please do.

11:59.710 --> 12:03.270
Why do I feel like doing something wrong?!

12:03.660 --> 12:04.550
DRESSING ROOM

12:04.550 --> 12:07.370
DRESSING ROOM
Thank you so much for your help!

12:08.310 --> 12:11.370
I'm Lemon, the older sister.

12:11.370 --> 12:13.270
And I'm Lime, the younger brother.

12:13.270 --> 12:15.090
Let's have a fun cosplay today!

12:15.510 --> 12:18.270
Yes, likewise!
I'm Liliel!

12:18.270 --> 12:20.850
So you were the one
the rumors were about?

12:20.850 --> 12:23.290
Then, you must be with
Nonoa and Mikarin, right?

12:23.290 --> 12:24.560
That's cool!

12:25.900 --> 12:26.910
Umm...

12:27.560 --> 12:31.130
I'm sorry you had to
see me like that earlier.

12:31.130 --> 12:33.490
Didn't you dislike it?

12:33.490 --> 12:34.020
Huh?

12:34.550 --> 12:41.190
That's... Many people find
crossdressing cosplayers are gross, so...

12:41.190 --> 12:42.810
What are you talking about?!

12:42.810 --> 12:43.490
What?

12:43.490 --> 12:47.510
You're so cute!
Your cosplay is just perfect!

12:47.510 --> 12:50.960
You're a perfect Shiro from head to toe!

12:52.800 --> 12:55.290
T-Thank you very much.

12:55.290 --> 12:55.750
Eh?

12:55.750 --> 12:59.650
Senior! You really don't care
about gender when it comes to 2D?!

12:59.650 --> 13:02.430
That'd just double the amount
of my rivals on earth!

13:02.890 --> 13:05.030
By the way, that's a wonderful costume!

13:05.030 --> 13:07.760
What relentless attention to detail!

13:07.760 --> 13:09.010
You can tell?!

13:09.010 --> 13:12.810
It's custom-made, but I was too fussy
about the details to have it made!

13:13.630 --> 13:16.820
I told them that these parts had to be
made of leather to match the luster,

13:16.820 --> 13:19.270
and the patterns should be
embroidered instead of printed!

13:19.270 --> 13:22.090
- I get how you feel! It looks so real!
- Even if it's handmade or not,

13:22.090 --> 13:23.840
- they're trying to stay true
- This is a quality that could only

13:23.840 --> 13:25.700
- to the source, just like Liliel's.
- be achieved by a professional!

13:26.060 --> 13:28.550
No wonder their costumes look so amazing.

13:28.550 --> 13:30.610
Since we're twins,

13:30.610 --> 13:35.070
we watch the same anime and spend the same
amount of time on our favorite things.

13:35.070 --> 13:38.550
We just can't help but fall in love
with twin characters.

13:41.660 --> 13:45.340
The Shiro Kuro twins are the characters
that we put a lot of love and passion into,

13:45.340 --> 13:48.300
it's the best cosplay we've ever done.

13:51.150 --> 13:52.900
Alright, we'll be going now.

13:53.310 --> 13:55.570
Let's do our best as ranking rivals!

13:55.570 --> 13:56.980
Y-Yes.

13:57.490 --> 13:59.680
See you at the venue!

14:03.710 --> 14:07.010
It's refreshing and pleasant
to see kids these days.

14:07.010 --> 14:09.200
It's rare to find a type
of cosplayer like Nagomi

14:09.200 --> 14:11.520
who's capable
but always wants to compete.

14:11.520 --> 14:13.780
I heard that.

14:13.780 --> 14:14.370
But...

14:15.870 --> 14:17.710
They're certainly formidable opponents.

14:18.320 --> 14:22.720
Their love and commitment to the character
are strong, and their appearances are perfect.

14:23.110 --> 14:28.450
And they chose the most popular characters
of the season, which is hard for you.

14:29.330 --> 14:32.630
To be honest, I feel they're more
of a threat to me than Liliel.

14:35.360 --> 14:38.010
Even Nagomi feels threatened by them...

14:39.490 --> 14:43.940
Will it really be possible for us
to stand out the most?

14:43.940 --> 14:48.450
B-But... We have to do our best for Aria.

14:49.190 --> 14:50.800
Are you okay, Lilysa?

14:50.800 --> 14:51.590
Eh?

14:51.590 --> 14:53.190
We have to go now.

14:53.190 --> 14:55.870
If we wait too long,
we'll lose our spot.

14:55.870 --> 14:59.960
Ah, y-you're right!
Let's go to the venue!

14:59.960 --> 15:02.170
EAST, WEST, SOUTH HALLS

15:03.110 --> 15:07.260
Swimsuit-type outfits are not allowed
at the entrance and in the garden.

15:07.260 --> 15:11.930
Because the non-Comiket participants
will see them there.

15:11.930 --> 15:13.480
Oh, I see.

15:14.050 --> 15:17.060
Our costumes are not very revealing,

15:17.620 --> 15:20.100
but since Aria's costume is a bikini type,

15:20.100 --> 15:22.720
let's go to the rooftop venue just in case.

15:22.720 --> 15:23.780
Yeah.

15:38.580 --> 15:40.590
Wow!

15:41.350 --> 15:43.700
So these are cosplayers at Comiket...

15:43.700 --> 15:45.590
The scale here is just unreal.

15:45.590 --> 15:48.380
I'm used to being in front of people,

15:48.380 --> 15:51.130
but the enthusiasm here is amazing...

15:51.130 --> 15:52.980
Y-You too, Mikarin?

15:52.980 --> 15:55.830
Ugh, I'm getting nervous now...

15:55.830 --> 15:56.630
Huh?

15:57.680 --> 15:59.440
Even Nonopi?!

15:59.440 --> 16:02.000
I-I've been here before,

16:02.000 --> 16:05.610
but when it comes time to stand
in the middle of all this, I'm nervous.

16:06.730 --> 16:07.610
They're...

16:08.070 --> 16:09.950
Shiro Kuro from Hell Maids!

16:09.950 --> 16:11.300
It's Lemon and Lime!

16:11.300 --> 16:12.650
They're so cute!

16:12.650 --> 16:16.570
There's a lot of people cosplaying Shiro Kuro,
but I guess Lemon and Lime are just better!

16:16.570 --> 16:18.160
Their levels are just different.

16:18.160 --> 16:20.910
I'm starting to feel embarrassed
all of a sudden...

16:20.910 --> 16:22.540
Let's find another spot.

16:22.880 --> 16:25.630
Ah, we should hurry
and find a spot too!

16:25.630 --> 16:28.190
Huh? Already?
But I'm not ready...

16:28.190 --> 16:30.090
If you don't gather up your courage

16:30.500 --> 16:32.020
you won't be able to get a spot!

16:32.630 --> 16:35.690
"I'm gonna be the most famous cosplayer..."

16:35.690 --> 16:38.180
"I’m gonna be the best
out of everyone here…"

16:38.180 --> 16:40.310
That's what I said...

16:40.310 --> 16:42.550
But the scale and the level are just too much...

16:42.550 --> 16:44.690
I'm getting super nervous...

16:45.940 --> 16:47.150
Aria?

16:48.830 --> 16:52.330
I underestimate it...
I really underestimate cosplaying...

16:52.330 --> 16:53.500
I regret it.

16:53.500 --> 16:56.410
I'm kind of embarrassed
and want to go home...

17:03.840 --> 17:05.420
Nonopi...

17:07.040 --> 17:08.940
Let's do this, Aria.

17:08.940 --> 17:11.090
If you keep sniffling like that,
we'll leave you.

17:11.850 --> 17:14.300
Lilysa... Mikarin...

17:14.680 --> 17:16.380
BAAN

17:16.380 --> 17:19.480
BAAN
That's right. I'm not alone.

17:22.230 --> 17:23.050
Yeah.

17:24.590 --> 17:27.730
This character has the same face as me.

17:28.830 --> 17:31.700
If dad really is drawing Liliel's side story...

17:33.200 --> 17:34.990
Then maybe Ariel...

17:38.570 --> 17:41.830
I want dad to see me in this costume!

17:43.260 --> 17:44.940
It's Liliel!

17:44.940 --> 17:46.630
Wait, Mikarin?! The real one?!

17:46.630 --> 17:47.840
Nonoa!

17:47.840 --> 17:50.860
The girl cosplaying Ariel is super cute!

17:50.860 --> 17:52.770
What a perfect combo!

17:56.170 --> 17:57.790
We'll be in your care!

18:01.950 --> 18:03.980
Mikarin so cute!

18:03.980 --> 18:05.710
Nonoa, smile!

18:10.300 --> 18:12.300
This is a good start, right?

18:12.300 --> 18:14.730
They can gather a crowd in an instant.

18:14.730 --> 18:16.890
You're so naive.
This is just the beginning.

18:16.890 --> 18:17.580
Huh?

18:25.600 --> 18:27.590
The Summer Comiket begins here.

18:30.190 --> 18:31.510
Any updates, Mita?

18:31.840 --> 18:32.400
Huh?

18:32.400 --> 18:34.280
Anyone posting Liliel yet?

18:34.280 --> 18:37.020
You guys are looking forward
to it more than Sensei.

18:37.020 --> 18:41.660
Of course! Who do you think
fills in Liliel's skin tones every week?!

18:41.660 --> 18:44.350
I tone her as if she were my own daughter.

18:45.030 --> 18:48.490
See? Your Liliel sure is loved.

18:49.220 --> 18:51.010
So, how is it going?

18:51.950 --> 18:54.820
It's been about two hours
since Comiket opened...

18:55.290 --> 18:57.510
- But no one uploaded Liliel yet.
- Please look here!

19:02.790 --> 19:04.750
Wait, something's off.

19:05.170 --> 19:07.750
People are surrounding them
and taking pictures of them...

19:07.750 --> 19:10.180
But the crowd isn't increasing?

19:10.870 --> 19:13.130
I knew it wasn't gonna be easy.

19:13.130 --> 19:15.220
Ms. Mayuri, this is...

19:15.650 --> 19:19.710
As I've said before, there is too much
fluidity of people at Comiket.

19:20.160 --> 19:22.180
People just don't have a lot of time.

19:22.640 --> 19:24.090
- You've got Mikarin?
- People just want to shop.

19:24.090 --> 19:26.010
- Yeah. Okay, off to the next one.
- And the venue is too big to photograph everyone,

19:26.010 --> 19:27.790
- Yeah. Okay, off to the next one.
- even if they went around for a day.

19:27.790 --> 19:30.580
People are coming thanks to
Mikarin's advertising,

19:30.580 --> 19:32.890
but they're just as quick to leave.

19:33.280 --> 19:34.360
B-But...

19:36.820 --> 19:40.030
Their crowd is only getting bigger...

19:41.190 --> 19:42.810
They sure may be popular,

19:42.810 --> 19:45.730
but there should be no difference
with us in quality or popularity.

19:45.730 --> 19:49.690
No, I think ours is better known
because of Mikari's cheat...

19:49.690 --> 19:50.780
But why?

19:50.780 --> 19:52.750
Did you get some of Nonoa and Liliel?

19:53.710 --> 19:54.750
I went over there,

19:54.750 --> 19:57.460
but I couldn't get a good picture,
so I just went right back.

19:57.460 --> 20:00.380
Lemon and Lime are really well prepared.

20:00.380 --> 20:03.100
Mr. Camera really knows how to rank them.

20:04.180 --> 20:06.810
Good picture? Well prepared?

20:07.270 --> 20:08.520
Okumura!

20:08.520 --> 20:09.610
Ah!

20:09.610 --> 20:11.220
How are you doing?

20:11.220 --> 20:14.880
Well, it's been pretty hard
to increase the crowd...

20:14.880 --> 20:15.740
Oh?

20:17.360 --> 20:19.790
It feels like things are somewhat
awkward between them.

20:19.790 --> 20:20.540
Huh?

20:20.540 --> 20:23.280
That's the cons of doing joint cosplay.

20:23.280 --> 20:27.520
When there are many people in a group,
it is difficult to take good pictures

20:27.520 --> 20:30.380
since it'll be hard to communicate
about poses and eye contact.

20:30.700 --> 20:32.220
I mean, I don't think they've done

20:32.220 --> 20:34.900
any more different poses besides
the 2-3 poses they're doing.

20:34.900 --> 20:38.310
You're right!
They keep repeating the same poses!

20:38.310 --> 20:42.190
Liliel's strength is in her
infinite posing variations.

20:42.190 --> 20:45.310
But the other three cannot keep up with her.

20:46.410 --> 20:51.250
Since there are four of us, I really want us
to do that pose, and that pose, and that!

20:51.250 --> 20:54.360
That's also why she's limiting
the number of poses she's doing.

20:54.870 --> 20:57.760
That's why photographers
are so quick to come and go.

20:57.760 --> 20:58.360
It is also painful to watch when

20:58.360 --> 20:59.110
EYES HALF CLOSED
It is also painful to watch when

20:59.110 --> 20:59.410
BLINK
It is also painful to watch when

20:59.410 --> 20:59.860
BLINK
their eyes blink and don't match.

20:59.860 --> 21:00.860
LOOKING ANOTHER WAY
their eyes blink and don't match.

21:00.860 --> 21:02.010
CUTE
their eyes blink and don't match.

21:02.010 --> 21:03.770
CUTE
The photographer also wants

21:03.770 --> 21:05.330
CUTE
to show off their pictures to others.

21:05.330 --> 21:07.060
- I can't upload this.
- It's hard to show their pictures to others

21:07.060 --> 21:08.730
- I can't get any good pictures.
- It's hard to show their pictures to others

21:08.730 --> 21:10.900
- Mikarin really carries them solo.
- if their pictures aren't perfect.

21:10.900 --> 21:12.170
Let's find other cosplayers.

21:12.720 --> 21:16.160
The overwhelming number of poses
and Liliel's strong points,

21:16.160 --> 21:20.540
such as her careful eye contact and her ability
to gather crowds and keep them close,

21:20.540 --> 21:23.220
are not being demonstrated at all today.

21:24.260 --> 21:25.460
On the other hand,

21:25.460 --> 21:27.410
- Let's take good pictures!
- the twins share a mutual bond,

21:27.410 --> 21:29.340
- I've been waiting from the front row!
- so their combo is perfect.

21:29.340 --> 21:29.910
- That's likely what sets you
and the twins apart.

21:29.910 --> 21:30.730
- Let's do this!
- That's likely what

21:30.730 --> 21:32.030
sets you and the twins apart.

21:32.030 --> 21:33.580
I-I see...

21:33.580 --> 21:34.190
Furthermore...

21:34.780 --> 21:36.870
They're getting scorched over there.

21:38.650 --> 21:40.110
Stay hydrated!

21:41.650 --> 21:44.570
- Sorry, we'll be taking a short break!
- Nonopi, let's take a break.

21:45.030 --> 21:46.630
I must go!

21:48.330 --> 21:50.270
It is a critical time.

21:53.140 --> 21:56.570
I didn't know a wig would be this hot.

21:56.570 --> 21:59.230
We can't remove them here too...

21:59.230 --> 22:01.470
Nonoa, your makeup's melting.

22:01.950 --> 22:03.020
Ms. Mayuri...

22:03.020 --> 22:05.740
The most important thing
in Summer Comiket is to take a break.

22:06.230 --> 22:08.710
At this point, people leave at once.

22:08.710 --> 22:09.310
What?

22:21.140 --> 22:22.390
This is bad...

22:22.880 --> 22:24.320
At this rate...

23:55.100 --> 24:01.200
A WORLD MADE WITH FRIENDS
